Z||000000||EdsB52||06-14-2001||05:50 PM||||I emailed the guy for a price and specs, he replied with this:<P><BR>Fiero Turbo kit      500 hp +  <BR>Kit includes:<BR>-Turbo AR.82 trim 59 mm (+500 hp)  NEW (no used parts) <BR>-Heat shield<BR>-Exhaust from  headers to turbo(Note special expansion joints)<BR>-Exhaust headers  <BR>-Exhaust from turbo to tips (SPECIAL HAND MADE MUFLER)<BR>-Oil parts to turbo /From turbo <BR>-Water cooling  Inc.silicone hoses (turbo center section)<BR>-Exhaust gasket for headers/cyl.head<BR>-Exhaust hangers <BR>-Paste for flanges <BR>-Termotec one roll<BR>-Presure pipe from compressor to cooler – intake manifold (aluminum)<BR>-silicone hoses<BR>-Pipe clamps<BR>-Haltec E6GM ECU Base  program included for 500 cc injectors  !!! <BR>-Injectors 500 cc  (6) <BR>-Oil cooler .extra flanges ,pipes,hoses and hangers <BR>-Oil Filter<BR>-K&N air filter <BR>-Spark plugs V59C<BR>-All bolts and harware <BR>-Pictures <BR>-installion instructions and tips <BR>-Tuning tips <BR>-WATER cooled intercooler( value  $ 430 ) only cooler no pumps or <BR>second heat exchanger (option pump , lines ,exchanger, tank ++)<P>Needs welding on turbo oil return line (oil pan) and exhaust hangers to Frame .<BR>All parts are JIG made <BR>Needs engine modifications (pistons ,327 chevy rods ,oil pump ,cam++)<BR>Manual trasmission MUST!!<BR>Needs new fuel pump (option )<P>Price $ 5500 + shipping <P>Pre ORDERS only  50% deposit <P>AMW <P>Juha Martikainen <P>Would the 2.8 crank handle this? This might be better with a 3.4 push rod. The problem is the tranny. Wouldn't this be fun???  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> Does anyone know if these numbers are legit? Has anyone tried this unit or their bottom end unit that sells for a reasonable $2300?<p>[This message has been edited by EdsB52 (edited 06-14-2001).]||||reg||1
