Z||000009||danny boy||06-15-2001||11:32 PM|||| Oh great, here we go with somebody else that thinks a 3000GT is fast....    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR> Extreme motorsports recommends no more than 14psi with stock injectors!You'll hit fuelcut!T/T parts aren't cheap!<BR>  <BR>    That much boost will kill a motor not set up for it. Most Fiero kits use too small of a turbo and no intercooler whatsoever. All they do if turned up is force in a whole lot of heat. <P>[This message has been edited by danny boy (edited 06-15-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by danny boy (edited 06-15-2001).]||||reg||1
