Z||000013||hugh||06-16-2001||07:09 AM||||The turbo might support that much hp,but the turbo by itself will not give you that much hp(500).Besides the modifications for strength,there are the changes for power,that is,head work for better flow,cam design,fuel management,drivetrain work(though not part of the engine work they are just as necessary).The rods they mention are probably Pink rods(not the color).I don't know how available they are.||||reg||1
